* ngspice startup flags for this project. Only picked up if ngspice is
* invoked from this directory (or this file is copied alongside wherever
* it's run from) -- ngspice reads .spiceinit from the current directory,
* not the repo root implicitly.
*
* sky130A's combined model library takes ~2 minutes to parse regardless
* (confirmed upstream: https://github.com/iic-jku/IIC-OSIC-TOOLS/issues/262
* -- it's the library text parsing itself, not something these flags fix).
* These give a small, free improvement on top of that, nothing more.
set ngbehavior=hsa
set skywaterpdk
set ng_nomodcheck
set num_threads=8
option noinit
option klu
